            "src": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/daniyasa-pixel/eduyasa/main/kelas-3/pkn/assets/pkn-b02-gambar-01.svg",
            "alt": "Poster berisi tiga aturan: dengarkan guru, angkat tangan, baca bergiliran."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "K03-PKN-B02-M01-052",
